WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
That bumpkin circle that rides a three-wheeler

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:04,120
How many million in cash commission?

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,680
If I had just gone up and handed him a glass of water,

4
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:07,160
Really, more than one million is mine.

5
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:12,580
I really killed Gouyan, brother

6
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,060
Are you free tonight?

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,100
I really want to be my girlfriend

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,420
I thought I was in the lobby of the villa just now

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,820
That's your joke, schoolgirl

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,140
Senior brother, you are so handsome and capable

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,580
How can I not have a girlfriend?

12
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,980
I don't believe it

13
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,060
Being handsome has no use

14
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:30,460
It makes perfect sense to throw 45 million down. I don’t believe it or not, you are there.

15
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,020
Actually I don't mean anything else

16
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,420
I just want to treat you to a casual meal

17
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,420
express thanks

18
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,580
You made me earn more than one million in commissions at once

19
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,260
This is something I never dreamed of

20
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,380
It doesn’t matter whether you eat or not

21
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,420
If you really want to thank me

22
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,420
Do me a small favor tomorrow

23
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,500
Tomorrow afternoon I will receive some important guests in Building 18

24
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,540
Lack of a sensible reception

25
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:47,300
Could you please help me explain who the guests are at tea and what kind of party it is?

26
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,580
It can't be a party, right?

27
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,780
It's a private auction

28
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,780
Auction of top quality jadeite

29
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,280
I will definitely arrive at Top Jade on time
